# Castafiore - Session Log

## 2026-08-04
- Tracks tab implemented (5th bottom-bar element between Search and Playlists).
  - `Navigation.js`: added `TracksStack` tab (`title: 'Tracks'`, icon `music`).
  - `Stacks.js`: new `TracksStack` (Tracks + shared Pres screens).
  - `app/screens/tabs/Tracks.js`: header "Tracks" + layout toggle (grid/list), `Selector`
    switches Songs/Alubums/Artists; embeds SongExplorer/AlbumExplorer/ArtistExplorer with
    `showHeader={false}` and the chosen `layout`.
- Explorer screens (`SongExplorer`, `AlbumExplorer`, `ArtistExplorer`) now accept
  `layout` ('list'|'grid') and `showHeader` props. Grid reuses `AllItem` in a flexWrap
  ScrollView (native 2-col, web auto-fill) + `onScroll` pagination for songs/albums; the
  artist sidebar shows only in list mode.
- Removed the Favorited/Favorites section from the Playlists tab (`Playlists.js`); dropped
  unused `SongsList` import and `navigation` prop. The `Favorited` screen and desktop
  SideBar entry remain (SideBar still navigates to `PlaylistsStack`/`Favorited`).
- i18n: added `tabs.Tracks` and top-level `Tracks` to en.json.

## tips / gotchas
- The three Explorer screens are used both as standalone screens (from Search) and embedded
  in the Tracks tab. Layout state lives in `Tracks.js` and is passed down as a prop.
- Grid view is non-virtualized (flexWrap ScrollView) — same trade-off as SearchMore grid.
- `addToQueue(songDispatch, track, index)` inserts at `index`; inserting at the same
  `index` repeatedly reverses order, so insert in reverse to keep wanted order.
- eslint: `npx eslint app -c eslint.config.mjs`.